<section>
    <section data-background="#e6f0fa">
        <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i> Retrieval Practice</h3>
        <div class="box-blue">
            <p class="small-text" style="margin:0;">Recall B3.2 (Inheritance &amp; Polymorphism) before patterns.</p>
        </div>
        <ol style="font-size:1.1em; line-height:1.6; margin-top:1rem;">
            <li>What is polymorphism in OOP?</li>
            <li>What is the difference between composition and aggregation?</li>
            <li>What is the purpose of an interface?</li>
        </ol>
        <p class="small-text" style="margin-top: 20px; color: #666;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i> Press Down for answers
        </p>
